  1:Name            D4-RCTLA D4 PAGE RAM BOARD Control logic;
  2:PartNo          108352-001;
  3:Revision        01;
  4:Date            16/5/26;
  5:Designer        Dave Henry;
  6:Company         Breadboarding Labs;
  7:Location        None;
  8:Assembly        None;
  9:Device          g16v8;
 10:
 11:/* 15/05/2026 V1 Initial version converted from PALASM format in COMPAQ design doc         */
 12:/*                                                                                         */
 13:/*******************************************************************************************/
 14:/*                                                                                         */
 15:/*******************************************************************************************/
 16:/*
 17:DESCRIPTION
 18:This PAL is used in the D4 (386) memory board to control the DRAM subsystem.
 19:The RAS and CAS master strobes are generated, and the CPU next address and
 20:READY signals are provided.
 21:Rev A of this PAL changes the DMA state machine to prevent spurious RAM cycles
 22:after refresh or DMA cycles.
 23:*/
 24:/* Pin Map 
 25:                               ______________
 26:                              |   D4-RCTLA   |
 27:                      CLK x---|1           20|---x Vcc                      
 28:                    !ADSM x---|2           19|---x !YY                      
 29:                    !DMIO x---|3           18|---x !MRD                     
 30:                      D_C x---|4           17|---x !MWE                     
 31:                      W_R x---|5           16|---x !MRDY                    
 32:                     !M32 x---|6           15|---x !MCAS                    
 33:                     HLDA x---|7           14|---x !NAM                     
 34:                   !CLK16 x---|8           13|---x !SWM                     
 35:                     !HIT x---|9           12|---x !MRAS                    
 36:                      GND x---|10          11|---x !OE                      
 37:                              |______________|
 38:
 39:*/
 40:
 41:PIN 1 = CLK ;
 42:PIN 2 = !ADSM ;
 43:PIN 3 = !DMIO ;
 44:PIN 4 = D_C ;
 45:PIN 5 = W_R ;
 46:PIN 6 = !M32 ;
 47:PIN 7 = HLDA ;
 48:PIN 8 = !CLK16 ;
 49:PIN 9 = !HIT ;
 50:PIN 11 = !OE ;
 51:PIN 12 = !MRAS ;
 52:PIN 13 = !SWM ;
 53:PIN 14 = !NAM ;

LISTING FOR LOGIC DESCRIPTION FILE: D4-RCTLA.pld                     Page 2

CUPL(WM): Universal Compiler for Programmable Logic
Version 5.0a Serial# MW-10400000
